new file mode 100644
index 00000000..1673af42
--- /dev/null
+++ b/NRE_BUILD.md
@@ -0,0 +1,33 @@
+# Build for NRE
+
+This package contains a dependency of `plyfile` which is GPL-licensed. Hence we have this clone to remove that dependency.
+
+## Build instructions
+
+```bash
+# Create a new conda environment
+conda create -n viser-build python=3.10
+conda activate viser-build
+
+# (Optionally) Append an additional identifier to the version number
+sed -i 's/__version__ = "\(.*\)"/__version__ = "\1+nre5"/' src/viser/__init__.py
+# Need to install (in editable mode) before running `sync_client_server.py`
+pip install -e ".[dev]"
+python sync_client_server.py
+
+# Follow the procedure documented in .github/publish.yml
+pip install build twine
+# Build client files.
+python -c "import viser; viser.ViserServer()"
+# This should delete everything in src/viser/client except for the
+# build folder + original source files. We don't want to package
+# .nodeenv, node_modules, etc in the release.
+rm -rf src/viser/client/.nodeenv
+rm -rf src/viser/client/node_modules
+
+# Build the package
+python -m build
+
+# Upload to Gitlab (NRE)
+twine upload --username $PYPI_USERNAME --password $PYPI_PASSWORD --repository-url <NVIDIA-internal-package-registry-url> dist/* --verbose --skip-existing
+```
